# Store and check out text files with LF on every platform. This overrides
# core.autocrlf=true on Windows, which otherwise warns "LF will be replaced
# by CRLF" for files written with LF (Zephyr/west tooling, editors, OpenSCAD).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary

# Generated ASCII STL meshes: keep LF, but don't show line diffs
*.stl -diff
